WEBVTT

00:10:28.798 --> 00:10:30.252
(Laughter)

00:10:30.276 --> 00:10:33.887
But fear is not
what is going to motivate us

00:10:33.911 --> 00:10:37.709
for the long-term, sustained change
that we need to fix this thing.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:42.061
Fear is designed to help us
run away from the bear.

00:10:42.085 --> 00:10:44.442
Or just run faster
than the person beside us.

00:10:44.466 --> 00:10:45.616
(Laughter)

00:10:47.374 --> 00:10:51.892
What we need to fix this thing
is rational hope.

00:10:52.939 --> 00:10:56.379
Yes, we absolutely do need
to recognize what's at stake.

00:10:56.403 --> 00:10:57.553
Of course we do.

00:10:58.673 --> 00:11:02.226
But we need a vision of a better future --